#, xml-text
#~ msgid "Fix a bug introduced in grub-2.14:"
#~ msgstr "Corrija um defeito introduzido no grub-2.14:"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "If your system has UEFI support and you wish to boot LFS with UEFI, you need"
#~ " to install GRUB with UEFI support (and its dependencies) by following the "
#~ "instructions on <ulink url=\"&blfs-book;postlfs/grub-efi.html\">the BLFS "
#~ "page</ulink>.  You may skip this package, or install this package and the "
#~ "BLFS GRUB for UEFI package without conflict (the BLFS page provides "
#~ "instructions for both cases)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Se o teu sistema tem suporte UEFI e você desejar inicializar o LFS com UEFI,"
#~ " você precisa instalar o GRUB com suporte UEFI (e as dependências dele) "
#~ "seguindo as instruções na <ulink url=\"&blfs-book;postlfs/grub-"
#~ "efi.html\">página BLFS</ulink>. Você pode ignorar esse pacote ou instalar "
#~ "esse pacote e o pacote GRUB para UEFI do BLFS sem conflito (a página BLFS "
#~ "fornece instruções para ambos os casos)."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Making your LFS system bootable with GRUB will be discussed in <xref "
#~ "linkend=\"ch-bootable-grub\" role='.'/>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tornar teu sistema LFS inicializável com GRUB será discutido no <xref "
#~ "linkend=\"ch-bootable-grub\" role='.'/>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid "Add a file missing from the release tarball:"
#~ msgstr "Adicione um arquivo ausente a partir do tarball de lançamento:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap='pre'>echo <literal>depends bli part_gpt</literal> &gt; "
#~ "grub-core/extra_deps.lst</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap='pre'>echo <literal>depends bli part_gpt</literal> &gt; "
#~ "grub-core/extra_deps.lst</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Install the package, and move the Bash completion support file to the "
#~ "location recommended by the Bash completion maintainers:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Instale o pacote e mova o arquivo de suporte à completação do Bash para o "
#~ "local recomendado pelos(as) mantenedores(as) da completação do Bash:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install\n"
#~ "mv -v /etc/bash_completion.d/grub /usr/share/bash-completion/completions</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install\n"
#~ "mv -v /etc/bash_completion.d/grub /usr/share/bash-completion/completions</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Fix an issue causing <command>grub-install</command> to fail when the "
#~ "<filename class='directory'>/boot</filename> partition (or the root "
#~ "partition if <filename class='directory'>/boot</filename> is not a separate "
#~ "partition) is created by e2fsprogs-1.47.0 or later:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Corrija um problema que causa <command>grub-install</command> falhar quando "
#~ "a partição <filename class='directory'>/boot</filename> (ou a partição raiz,"
#~ " se <filename class='directory'>/boot</filename> não for uma partição "
#~ "separada) for criada por e2fsprogs-1.47.0 ou posterior:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap='pre'>patch -Np1 -i ../grub-&grub-"
#~ "version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap='pre'>patch -Np1 -i ../grub-&grub-"
#~ "version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

